  <title>Release notes from dynamo</title>
  <updated>2026-10-21T22:06:01Z</updated>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/942206898/v1.6.0</id>
    <updated>2026-10-23T04:08:42Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/releases/tag/v1.6.0"/>
    <title>Dynamo v1.6.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo v1.6.0 - Release Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo v1.6.0 is the 19th feature release of the open-source distributed inference platform, spanning 654 merged PRs from 148 contributors. &lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Router&lt;/strong&gt; gains pluggable flow control: request classifiers can defer, reorder, or steer requests, and every selection path now runs on one shared core with scoring knobs consolidated into one policy file. On Kubernetes, LPX brings LPU-backed inference to DynamoGraphDeployments, multinode components take role-specific pod templates, and Dynamo Snapshot backs engine failover. &lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Planner&lt;/strong&gt; reconfigures GPU budgets at runtime, and the engines move to SGLang v0.5.21, TensorRT-LLM v1.3.0rc29, and vLLM v0.31.0.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Router: Pluggable Flow Control &amp;amp; Unified Selection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo Router opens request intake to plugins. A request-classifier hook lets a plugin defer a request, override validated scheduling inputs, or suggest a worker without overriding explicit worker pins (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5315591177&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14123&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14123/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14123&quot;&gt;#14123&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5321142597&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14177&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14177/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14177&quot;&gt;#14177&lt;/a&gt;). Every request now flows through the policy queue, which orders requests by deadline (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5321142073&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14176&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14176/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14176&quot;&gt;#14176&lt;/a&gt;). ThunderAgent ships as a builtin plugin (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5535805009&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15164&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15164/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15164&quot;&gt;#15164&lt;/a&gt;). Dynamo Frontend, the standalone selection service, and the Gateway API endpoint picker (EPP) now share one worker-selection core (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5406232938&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14570&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14570/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14570&quot;&gt;#14570&lt;/a&gt;). Scoring knobs move into &lt;code&gt;--router-policy-config&lt;/code&gt;, and the older flags are deprecated (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5547780005&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15202&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15202/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15202&quot;&gt;#15202&lt;/a&gt;). An opt-in session prefix index tracks session-to-block lineage for agentic workloads (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5252602419&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13807&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13807/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13807&quot;&gt;#13807&lt;/a&gt;), and a versioned gRPC relay exposes KV pool state to consumers outside the data center (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5359914540&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14379&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14379/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14379&quot;&gt;#14379&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Frontend: Structured Parsing, Reranking &amp;amp; Error Fidelity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo Frontend adds opt-in V2 tool and reasoning parsers for eight model families, selected with &lt;code&gt;DYN_PARSER_VERSION&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5478666328&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14950&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14950/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14950&quot;&gt;#14950&lt;/a&gt;), with structural tags on by default for supported parsers (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5767478451&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15916&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15916/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15916&quot;&gt;#15916&lt;/a&gt;). DeepSeek V4.1 gains reasoning and tool-call support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5494248284&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15030&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15030/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15030&quot;&gt;#15030&lt;/a&gt;). An OpenAI-compatible &lt;code&gt;/v1/rerank&lt;/code&gt; endpoint serves SGLang cross-encoder models (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5296873019&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14032&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14032/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14032&quot;&gt;#14032&lt;/a&gt;), and a root-level &lt;code&gt;thinking_token_budget&lt;/code&gt; field caps reasoning tokens on SGLang and vLLM (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5057203596&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12624&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12624/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12624&quot;&gt;#12624&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5519875108&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15120&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15120/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15120&quot;&gt;#15120&lt;/a&gt;). Errors map to protocol-correct OpenAI and Anthropic responses (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5363694701&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14396&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14396/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14396&quot;&gt;#14396&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5284046972&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14002&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14002/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14002&quot;&gt;#14002&lt;/a&gt;). The Frontend HTTP server now supports mutual TLS (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5320628087&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14173&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14173/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14173&quot;&gt;#14173&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multimodal &amp;amp; Omni: Video-Aware Routing &amp;amp; New Speech Models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Video-aware KV routing extends from vLLM to SGLang for Qwen3-VL and Qwen3.5 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5491739089&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15014&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15014/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15014&quot;&gt;#15014&lt;/a&gt;), and Nemotron 3 Nano Omni gains exact image and video routing (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5405563478&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14564&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14564/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14564&quot;&gt;#14564&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5417427458&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14653&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14653/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14653&quot;&gt;#14653&lt;/a&gt;). vLLM-Omni adds Nemotron Audex text-to-speech (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5085390922&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12788&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12788/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12788&quot;&gt;#12788&lt;/a&gt;) and MiniMax-H3 text-to-video-and-audio generation (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5200213785&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13589&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13589/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13589&quot;&gt;#13589&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5421798834&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14702&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14702/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14702&quot;&gt;#14702&lt;/a&gt;). External encoders can reuse Dynamo&#39;s image extraction and prompt reconstruction through a public handoff API (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5156767651&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13293&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13293/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13293&quot;&gt;#13293&lt;/a&gt;). An opt-in shared cache of encoded images in Redis Cluster or Dragonfly saves repeated media fetches (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5418614375&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14676&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14676/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14676&quot;&gt;#14676&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes: LPX, Role Pod Templates &amp;amp; Snapshot Failover&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LPX components bring LPU-backed inference to DynamoGraphDeployments, with partition selection for hybrid builds and rolling build updates on Grove (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5502287558&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15062&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15062/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15062&quot;&gt;#15062&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5678584933&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15563&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15563/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15563&quot;&gt;#15563&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5701742093&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15607&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15607/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15607&quot;&gt;#15607&lt;/a&gt;). Multinode &lt;code&gt;worker&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;prefill&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;decode&lt;/code&gt; components can take separate leader and worker pod templates (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5385558718&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14468&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14468/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14468&quot;&gt;#14468&lt;/a&gt;), and the Operator injects portable &lt;code&gt;DYNAMO_RANK&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;DYNAMO_LEADER_ADDRESS&lt;/code&gt; variables (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5631128275&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15374&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15374/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15374&quot;&gt;#15374&lt;/a&gt;). Dynamo Snapshot backs active and standby engine failover for SGLang and vLLM (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5768436382&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15924&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15924/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15924&quot;&gt;#15924&lt;/a&gt;) and captures CUDA shared memory by default (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5739021653&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15791&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15791/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15791&quot;&gt;#15791&lt;/a&gt;). The GPU Memory Service adds Intel XPU support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5028397243&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12484&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12484/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12484&quot;&gt;#12484&lt;/a&gt;). The Rust Endpoint Picker scales past one replica (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5429909392&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14758&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14758/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14758&quot;&gt;#14758&lt;/a&gt;), and GA Helm charts publish to the NGC OCI registry (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5218298645&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13657&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13657/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13657&quot;&gt;#13657&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Planner &amp;amp; Performance Modeling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo Planner reconfigures endpoint floors and GPU budget bounds at runtime through &lt;code&gt;/v1/min-endpoints&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5329301264&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14218&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14218/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14218&quot;&gt;#14218&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5330021870&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14231&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14231/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14231&quot;&gt;#14231&lt;/a&gt;), caps how many replicas one throughput decision changes (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5342307544&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14296&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14296/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14296&quot;&gt;#14296&lt;/a&gt;), and keeps pending capacity when demand falls while a worker is still starting (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5418216014&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14671&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14671/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14671&quot;&gt;#14671&lt;/a&gt;). An experimental Planner Gym compares Planner, KEDA-style, reactive, and static autoscaling policies against replayed or live traffic (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5681479529&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15576&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15576/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15576&quot;&gt;#15576&lt;/a&gt;). Performance-model consumers across the Planner, Profiler, Router, Frontend, Mocker, and replay move to AISimulate&#39;s canonical configuration (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5502358375&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15063&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15063/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15063&quot;&gt;#15063&lt;/a&gt;). Replay gains typed agentic traces (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5199360837&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13586&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13586/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13586&quot;&gt;#13586&lt;/a&gt;), Codex and Claude trace export (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5693273332&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15601&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15601/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15601&quot;&gt;#15601&lt;/a&gt;), and host-memory KV offload in the Mocker (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5716210269&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15647&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15647/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15647&quot;&gt;#15647&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability &amp;amp; Transport&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo and engine metrics can export over OTLP to an OpenTelemetry Collector (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5304130881&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14071&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14071/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14071&quot;&gt;#14071&lt;/a&gt;), and opt-in lifecycle tracing models each request from arrival to completion (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5308557247&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14101&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14101/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14101&quot;&gt;#14101&lt;/a&gt;). The runtime warns on sustained Tokio queue pressure (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5122461946&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13027&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13027/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13027&quot;&gt;#13027&lt;/a&gt;). An opt-in batched QUIC response plane joins the default TCP path (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4944484713&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11996&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11996/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11996&quot;&gt;#11996&lt;/a&gt;), and IPv6-only fixes cover listeners, ZMQ, SGLang KV events, and vLLM multinode (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5634929659&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15383&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15383/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15383&quot;&gt;#15383&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open-Source Contributions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Between v1.5.1 and v1.6.0 the project merged 654 PRs from 148 contributors, 58 of them from outside NVIDIA. Thank you to the external community contributors in this release (organization identified through the commit-author email domain or the public GitHub profile):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DaoCloud:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/bzsuni&quot;&gt;@bzsuni&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/carlory&quot;&gt;@carlory&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cyclinder&quot;&gt;@cyclinder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/flpanbin&quot;&gt;@flpanbin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/git-jxj&quot;&gt;@git-jxj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/panpan0000&quot;&gt;@panpan0000&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/weizhoublue&quot;&gt;@weizhoublue&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/yankay&quot;&gt;@yankay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intel:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Jianhong-Zhang&quot;&gt;@Jianhong-Zhang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sandeep-maddipatla&quot;&gt;@sandeep-maddipatla&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/tthakkal&quot;&gt;@tthakkal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/VincyZhang&quot;&gt;@VincyZhang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/zxue2&quot;&gt;@zxue2&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CoreWeave:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/alexeldeib&quot;&gt;@alexeldeib&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/c2w-sea&quot;&gt;@c2w-sea&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/houshengbo&quot;&gt;@houshengbo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/surajssd&quot;&gt;@surajssd&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aliyun:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/xianlubird&quot;&gt;@xianlubird&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
