&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/surajssd&quot;&gt;@surajssd&lt;/a&gt; broke a KV router request-lease ownership cycle and retried NATS connections at startup (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5570826258&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15258&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15258/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15258&quot;&gt;#15258&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5577548923&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15269&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15269/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15269&quot;&gt;#15269&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JasperChan929&quot;&gt;@JasperChan929&lt;/a&gt; charged and gated explicit hard pins at ThunderAgent admission (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5598789985&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15290&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15290/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15290&quot;&gt;#15290&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/dundysm&quot;&gt;@dundysm&lt;/a&gt; kept &lt;code&gt;multi_modal_data&lt;/code&gt; on non-Qwen vLLM decode for image KV identity (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5627564276&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15371&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15371/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15371&quot;&gt;#15371&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/charan-rathore&quot;&gt;@charan-rathore&lt;/a&gt; placed the vLLM-Omni video &lt;code&gt;negative_prompt&lt;/code&gt; in the prompt entry (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5640878698&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15402&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15402/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15402&quot;&gt;#15402&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/awesome-pro&quot;&gt;@awesome-pro&lt;/a&gt; generated the nightly release ledger for the docs (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5642012481&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15410&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15410/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15410&quot;&gt;#15410&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sunil1511&quot;&gt;@sunil1511&lt;/a&gt; added shared NGC model fetching with SGLang and vLLM integration (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5651475513&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15441&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15441/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15441&quot;&gt;#15441&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/neilkg&quot;&gt;@neilkg&lt;/a&gt; passed the checkpoint tokenizer to SGLang parsers and eight more frontend and SGLang fidelity fixes (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5667006988&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15509&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15509/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15509&quot;&gt;#15509&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/kathleenfrench&quot;&gt;@kathleenfrench&lt;/a&gt; dropped the stale &lt;code&gt;dynamoGraphDeploymentRef&lt;/code&gt; from LPX bindings (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5667716335&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15522&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15522/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15522&quot;&gt;#15522&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/geelen&quot;&gt;@geelen&lt;/a&gt; let recipe cards without logos use the full header width (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5671417517&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15546&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15546/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15546&quot;&gt;#15546&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/joshhay95&quot;&gt;@joshhay95&lt;/a&gt; selected GPU-local partitions for hybrid and HX LPX builds (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5678584933&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15563&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15563/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15563&quot;&gt;#15563&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5728819607&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15706&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15706/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15706&quot;&gt;#15706&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ericcurtin&quot;&gt;@ericcurtin&lt;/a&gt; rejected vLLM-Omni TTS tasks the checkpoint cannot serve (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5685525634&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15591&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15591/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15591&quot;&gt;#15591&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mattwittwer&quot;&gt;@mattwittwer&lt;/a&gt; rejected non-numeric &lt;code&gt;logit_bias&lt;/code&gt; keys in the frontend (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5834903667&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/16322&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16322/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16322&quot;&gt;#16322&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Jianhong-Zhang&quot;&gt;@Jianhong-Zhang&lt;/a&gt; upgraded SGLang XPU to v0.5.19 on oneAPI 2026.0 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5889304235&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/16684&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16684/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16684&quot;&gt;#16684&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Special Interest Groups (SIGs)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo now has six Special Interest Groups (SIGs). Each SIG runs a public meeting, reviews the Dynamo Enhancement Proposals (DEPs) and PRs in its area, and sets that area&#39;s roadmap. Anyone in the community can join, bring a PR or DEP, and be involved in the technical direction of Dynamo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#sig-router:&lt;/strong&gt; KV-aware routing, Global Router, and Gateway API routing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#sig-engines:&lt;/strong&gt; SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, vLLM, TokenSpeed, and Dynamo Sidecar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#sig-frontend:&lt;/strong&gt; Frontend APIs, tool calling, and parsers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#sig-deploy:&lt;/strong&gt; Kubernetes Operator, Helm charts, DRA, and Grove.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#sig-agents:&lt;/strong&gt; Agentic inference, agent hints, and request tracing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#sig-rl:&lt;/strong&gt; RL integration, rollouts, and weight updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join the &lt;a href=&quot;https://ai-dynamo.org/slack&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;ai-dynamo Slack&lt;/a&gt; and find the channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subscribe to the &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.nvidia.com/dynamo/community&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;community calendar&lt;/a&gt; for meeting times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For how to contribute code, docs, and recipes, see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.nvidia.com/dynamo/dev/getting-started/contribution-guide&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Contribution Guide&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
